---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support — Verso AI" description="Get help with Verso AI. Contact our team for questions, feedback, or support.">
  <Nav />

  <main class="min-h-screen px-[30px] nav:px-[60px] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1200px] mx-auto w-full">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h1 class="font-display text-[42px] nav:text-[54px] font-normal leading-tight text-brand mb-4">How can we help?</h1>
        <p class="text-base text-brand-muted">Browse our frequently asked questions or send us a message below.</p>
      </div>

      <!-- FAQ Section -->
      <div class="mb-16">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[28px] nav:text-[36px] font-normal text-brand mb-8 text-center">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 nav:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <!-- Getting Started -->
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>How do I get started with Verso AI?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Getting started is simple! Install Verso AI from the Microsoft Office Store, open PowerPoint, and look for the Verso AI add-in in your ribbon. Sign in with your account, and you're ready to start creating presentations with AI assistance.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>What can Verso AI do in PowerPoint?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Verso AI can create entire presentations from prompts, edit existing slides, apply professional designs, generate content, optimize layouts, maintain brand consistency, and help you iterate on your presentations. It works natively in PowerPoint, so all edits are made directly in your presentation.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Technical Questions -->
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>Which versions of PowerPoint are supported?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Verso AI works with PowerPoint for Microsoft 365, PowerPoint 2021, PowerPoint 2019, and PowerPoint on the web. Both Windows and Mac versions are fully supported.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>Does Verso AI work offline?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Verso AI requires an internet connection to generate and process AI content. However, once slides are created, you can continue editing them in PowerPoint offline as usual.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Pricing & Plans -->
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>What pricing plans are available?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>We offer flexible plans for individuals and teams. Start with our free trial to test all features. For pricing details and enterprise plans with custom features, advanced security, and dedicated support, please contact our sales team.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>Can I cancel my subscription anytime?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Yes, you can cancel your subscription at any time. Your access will continue until the end of your current billing period, and you won't be charged again.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Privacy & Security -->
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>Is my data secure and private?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Absolutely. We take data security seriously. Your presentations and data are encrypted in transit and at rest. We never train our AI models on your content, and we're compliant with enterprise security standards including SOC 2 and GDPR.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>Can I use Verso AI for commercial presentations?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Yes! All content generated by Verso AI is yours to use commercially. You retain full ownership and rights to your presentations and any AI-generated content within them.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Enterprise & Team -->
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>Do you offer team or enterprise plans?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Yes! Our enterprise plan includes centralized billing, team management, brand template libraries, advanced security features, SSO integration, dedicated support, and custom AI model configurations. Contact us for a demo tailored to your organization's needs.</p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <!-- Troubleshooting -->
          <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl border border-brand-border overflow-hidden transition hover:border-brand h-fit">
            <summary class="cursor-pointer px-6 py-4 font-semibold text-brand flex items-center justify-between list-none">
              <span>The add-in isn't showing up in PowerPoint. What should I do?</span>
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 transition-transform group-open:rotate-180 flex-shrink-0 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"></path>
              </svg>
            </summary>
            <div class="px-6 pb-4 text-brand-muted text-sm">
              <p>Try these steps: 1) Restart PowerPoint completely, 2) Check that you're signed in to your Microsoft account, 3) Go to Insert > Get Add-ins and verify Verso AI is installed, 4) Check your IT department hasn't blocked add-ins. If issues persist, contact our support team.</p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 text-center">
          <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm">Can't find what you're looking for? Send us a message using the form below.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Contact Form -->
      <div class="mt-16 max-w-[640px] mx-auto">
        <h2 class="font-display text-[28px] nav:text-[36px] font-normal text-brand mb-8 text-center">Send us a message</h2>

      <form action="https://formsubmit.co/adrien@get-verso.ai" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
        <input type="hidden" name="_subject" value="New support request from get-verso.ai" />
        <input type="hidden" name="_next" value="https://get-verso.ai/support/?sent=1" />
        <input type="text" name="_honey" style="display:none" />

        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
          <div>
            <label for="name" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand mb-2">Name</label>
            <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-pill border border-brand-border focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand/20 outline-none transition text-sm" />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="email" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand mb-2">Email</label>
            <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-pill border border-brand-border focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand/20 outline-none transition text-sm" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="subject" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand mb-2">Subject</label>
          <input type="text" id="subject" name="subject" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-pill border border-brand-border focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand/20 outline-none transition text-sm" />
        </div>

        <div>
          <label for="message" class="block text-sm font-semibold text-brand mb-2">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="5" required class="w-full px-4 py-3 rounded-xl border border-brand-border focus:border-brand focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand/20 outline-none transition text-sm resize-y"></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-brand text-white px-7 py-3.5 rounded-pill font-medium text-base transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-lg">
          Send Message
        </button>
      </form>

      <div id="success-msg" class="hidden mt-8 p-6 bg-brand/5 rounded-xl text-center">
        <div class="text-brand font-bold text-lg mb-1">Message sent!</div>
        <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm">We'll get back to you shortly.</p>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<script>
  if (new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).has('sent')) {
    document.getElementById('success-msg')?.classList.remove('hidden');
  }
</script>